#! program build/docs-examples/bin/tut13_view3d
#! args    --examples /tmp/figure-studio --case /tmp/figure-studio/plate
#! frames  500
#! poster  432
# F5 runs the solver; View > Run hides the Run panel; the 3-D button shows the field as a surface with the body; a drag
# orbits the camera; the grid; the cut along the probe line; the pointer reads the temperature, a click moves the
# Result panel's probe point there, and the Result tab shows it (the frames start once the run has surely ended)
